SupraLINUX — license summary
============================

This project is distributed under multiple licenses. The authoritative
license for each package is the one declared in its debian/copyright file.

Default for original code and configuration
-------------------------------------------
GPL-2.0-or-later, unless a file or package says otherwise.
Full text: LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt

Package-specific exceptions
---------------------------
- supralinux-drivers: GPL-3.0-or-later
  Full text: LICENSES/GPL-3.0-or-later.txt

- Artwork and wallpapers: CC-BY-4.0
  Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

- Sounds: CC0-1.0
  Full text: LICENSES/CC0-1.0.txt

- KDE/Breeze-derived theme parts: LGPL-2.1-or-later
  Full text: LICENSES/LGPL-2.1-or-later.txt

- Fonts: OFL-1.1
  Full text: LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt

- Vendored Go modules and other third-party code: their own licenses,
  as declared in the corresponding debian/copyright file.
  BSD texts: LICENSES/BSD-2-Clause.txt, LICENSES/BSD-3-Clause.txt

Documentation
-------------
Documentation is licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.
Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt

Third-party components
----------------------
See THIRD-PARTY.md for an index and each package's debian/copyright for
the complete attribution and license text.

Trademark
---------
No trademark license is granted by this file. See README.md for the
project's trademark and branding policy.
